('oak',3,'英语','Of course. Do you have your water?','["当然。水放好了吗？"]',0,'当然。水放好了吗？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-bedtime-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-bedtime-g3/s005-n-a7fe71.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Yes. Good night, Mom. I love you.','["放好了。妈妈晚安。我爱你。"]',0,'放好了。妈妈晚安。我爱你。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-bedtime-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-bedtime-g3/s006-n-09203d.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Lily, it''s time to get up. Are you awake?','["Lily，该起床了。你醒了吗？"]',0,'Lily，该起床了。你醒了吗？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-day-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-day-g3/s001-n-526226.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Yes, Mom. I''m getting up now.','["嗯，妈妈。我现在就起床。"]',0,'嗯，妈妈。我现在就起床。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-day-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-day-g3/s002-n-20cb71.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Please brush your teeth, then we''ll go to school.','["请先刷牙，然后我们去学校。"]',0,'请先刷牙，然后我们去学校。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-day-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-day-g3/s003-n-c51567.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Okay. Can you walk me to school today?','["好。你今天能送我去学校吗？"]',0,'好。你今天能送我去学校吗？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-day-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-day-g3/s004-n-bd06eb.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Of course. Don''t stay up too late tonight.','["当然。今晚别太晚睡。"]',0,'当然。今晚别太晚睡。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-day-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-day-g3/s005-n-b6c34a.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','I won''t. I''ll go to bed early.','["不会的。我会早点睡觉。"]',0,'不会的。我会早点睡觉。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-day-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-day-g3/s006-n-bf9c3a.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Hi Ben, you look tired. What''s wrong?','["嗨，Ben，你看起来很累。你怎么了？"]',0,'嗨，Ben，你看起来很累。你怎么了？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-feelings-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-feelings-g3/s001-n-0235e4.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','I''m really tired today. How about you?','["我今天真的很累。你呢？"]',0,'我今天真的很累。你呢？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-feelings-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-feelings-g3/s002-n-ed1dc7.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','I''m happy, but Lily looks sad.','["我很开心，可是 Lily 看起来很难过。"]',0,'我很开心，可是 Lily 看起来很难过。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-feelings-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-feelings-g3/s003-n-9dfafa.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Oh no. Is she okay?','["哎呀。她还好吗？"]',0,'哎呀。她还好吗？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-feelings-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-feelings-g3/s004-n-83f7a5.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','She says she feels sick. Can we help her?','["她说她不舒服。我们能帮帮她吗？"]',0,'她说她不舒服。我们能帮帮她吗？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-feelings-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-feelings-g3/s005-n-030469.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Yes. Let''s go and see her!','["好。我们去看看她吧！"]',0,'好。我们去看看她吧！',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-feelings-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-feelings-g3/s006-n-d6b3ab.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Mom, I bumped my knee. It hurts.','["妈妈，我磕到膝盖了。好疼。"]',0,'妈妈，我磕到膝盖了。好疼。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-hurt-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-hurt-g3/s001-n-ca756a.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Oh dear. Do you need a bandage?','["哎呀。你需要创可贴吗？"]',0,'哎呀。你需要创可贴吗？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-hurt-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-hurt-g3/s002-n-c0e0af.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Yes, please. Can you help me?','["需要，拜托了。你能帮帮我吗？"]',0,'需要，拜托了。你能帮帮我吗？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-hurt-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-hurt-g3/s003-n-06c39d.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Of course. Does it still hurt a lot?','["当然。还很疼吗？"]',0,'当然。还很疼吗？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-hurt-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-hurt-g3/s004-n-45aeda.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','A little. I also have a headache.','["还有一点。我还头疼。"]',0,'还有一点。我还头疼。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-hurt-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-hurt-g3/s005-n-146080.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Let''s sit down and rest.','["我们坐下休息一下吧。"]',0,'我们坐下休息一下吧。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-hurt-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-hurt-g3/s006-n-23fab6.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Hi, I''m Lily. What''s your name?','["你好，我是莉莉。你叫什么名字？"]',0,'你好，我是莉莉。你叫什么名字？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-intro-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-intro-g3/s001-n-327707.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','My name is Ben. I''m new here.','["我叫本。我是新来的。"]',0,'我叫本。我是新来的。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-intro-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-intro-g3/s002-n-1b84fa.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Nice to meet you, Ben. How old are you?','["很高兴认识你，本。你几岁了？"]',0,'很高兴认识你，本。你几岁了？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-intro-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-intro-g3/s003-n-829a7c.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','I''m nine. I like drawing. What do you like?','["我九岁。我喜欢画画。你喜欢什么？"]',0,'我九岁。我喜欢画画。你喜欢什么？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-intro-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-intro-g3/s004-n-4ddff1.mp3'),
