('oak',3,'英语','Sure! Thank you, Lily.','["好呀！谢谢你，莉莉。"]',0,'好呀！谢谢你，莉莉。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-intro-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-intro-g3/s006-n-451a17.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Mom, what''s for dinner tonight?','["妈妈，今晚吃什么？"]',0,'妈妈，今晚吃什么？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-meal-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-meal-g3/s001-n-7f93bd.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','We''re having chicken and vegetables. Are you hungry?','["我们吃鸡肉和蔬菜。你饿了吗？"]',0,'我们吃鸡肉和蔬菜。你饿了吗？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-meal-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-meal-g3/s002-n-1a9a8a.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Yes! Can I have some soup, please?','["饿了！我可以喝一点汤吗？"]',0,'饿了！我可以喝一点汤吗？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-meal-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-meal-g3/s003-n-0b3a70.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Of course. Do you want more rice?','["当然。你还要米饭吗？"]',0,'当然。你还要米饭吗？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-meal-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-meal-g3/s004-n-f67c56.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','No, thanks. This is enough for me.','["不用了，谢谢。这些对我够了。"]',0,'不用了，谢谢。这些对我够了。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-meal-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-meal-g3/s005-n-0dbfd9.mp3'),
