('oak',3,'英语','Thanks! I can''t find mine.','["谢谢！我找不到我的了。"]',0,'谢谢！我找不到我的了。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-needs-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-needs-g3/s003-n-3f0fa4.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Mom, I feel cold. Can I have my jacket, please?','["妈妈，我觉得冷。可以把我的外套给我吗？"]',0,'妈妈，我觉得冷。可以把我的外套给我吗？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-needs-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-needs-g3/s004-n-06106b.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Of course. Here it is.','["当然，给你。"]',0,'当然，给你。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-needs-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-needs-g3/s005-n-5bcd71.mp3'),
