('oak',3,'英语','Yes, but please be gentle. He is a little shy.','["可以，不过请轻一点。它有点害羞。"]',0,'可以，不过请轻一点。它有点害羞。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-pets-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-pets-g3/s003-n-47896e.mp3'),
