('oak',3,'英语','Yes. He likes to run in the park.','["喜欢。它喜欢在公园跑。"]',0,'喜欢。它喜欢在公园跑。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-pets-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-pets-g3/s005-n-9274f5.mp3'),
