('oak',3,'英语','Do you want to play tag with me?','["你想和我玩捉人游戏吗？"]',0,'你想和我玩捉人游戏吗？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-play-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-play-g3/s001-n-af9b9b.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Yes! Can my friend play too?','["想！我的朋友也能一起玩吗？"]',0,'想！我的朋友也能一起玩吗？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-play-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-play-g3/s002-n-5af65a.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Of course! Let''s play together.','["当然！我们一起玩吧。"]',0,'当然！我们一起玩吧。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-play-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-play-g3/s003-n-215844.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Let''s take turns. Who wants to go first?','["我们轮流来。谁想先来？"]',0,'我们轮流来。谁想先来？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-play-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-play-g3/s004-n-d387b8.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','You go first. I''ll count to ten.','["你先来。我数到十。"]',0,'你先来。我数到十。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-play-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-play-g3/s005-n-d0f2ff.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','That was fun! Can we play again tomorrow?','["真好玩！我们明天还能再玩吗？"]',0,'真好玩！我们明天还能再玩吗？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-play-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-play-g3/s006-n-602655.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','I''m sorry I bumped into you.','["对不起，我撞到你了。"]',0,'对不起，我撞到你了。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-polite-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-polite-g3/s001-n-b7f95c.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','That''s all right. Are you OK?','["没关系。你还好吗？"]',0,'没关系。你还好吗？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-polite-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-polite-g3/s002-n-b4a1fa.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Yes, thanks. Did I drop your book?','["没事，谢谢。我是不是弄掉了你的书？"]',0,'没事，谢谢。我是不是弄掉了你的书？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-polite-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-polite-g3/s003-n-7c3c96.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Yes. Can you pick it up, please?','["是的。你能把它捡起来吗？"]',0,'是的。你能把它捡起来吗？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-polite-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-polite-g3/s004-n-28a57d.mp3'),
