('oak',3,'英语','It''s next to the library. Do you need help?','["就在图书馆旁边。你需要帮忙吗？"]',0,'就在图书馆旁边。你需要帮忙吗？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-school-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-school-g3/s002-n-c6ecf6.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Yes, please. Can you show me the way?','["好的，谢谢。你能带我去吗？"]',0,'好的，谢谢。你能带我去吗？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-school-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-school-g3/s003-n-237d72.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Sure! What class do you have next?','["当然！你下一节是什么课？"]',0,'当然！你下一节是什么课？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-school-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-school-g3/s004-n-f8b39d.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','I have math. Is it in room three?','["我有数学课。是在三号教室吗？"]',0,'我有数学课。是在三号教室吗？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-school-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-school-g3/s005-n-950909.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Yes. Come with me!','["是的。跟我来！"]',0,'是的。跟我来！',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-school-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-school-g3/s006-n-28cb5e.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Excuse me. How much is this eraser?','["不好意思。这块橡皮多少钱？"]',0,'不好意思。这块橡皮多少钱？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-shop-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-shop-g3/s001-n-a5aa16.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','It''s two yuan. Would you like it?','["两块钱。你要买吗？"]',0,'两块钱。你要买吗？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-shop-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-shop-g3/s002-n-ee67d6.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Yes, please. I also want this pencil.','["要的，谢谢。我还想要这支铅笔。"]',0,'要的，谢谢。我还想要这支铅笔。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-shop-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-shop-g3/s003-n-197c39.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','The pencil is three yuan. That''s five yuan in all.','["铅笔三块。一共五块。"]',0,'铅笔三块。一共五块。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-shop-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-shop-g3/s004-n-974e58.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Here is five yuan. Can I have a bag, please?','["这是五块钱。可以给我一个袋子吗？"]',0,'这是五块钱。可以给我一个袋子吗？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-shop-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-shop-g3/s005-n-7d13e1.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Of course. Thank you. Have a nice day!','["当然可以。谢谢。祝你今天愉快！"]',0,'当然可以。谢谢。祝你今天愉快！',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-shop-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-shop-g3/s006-n-f4e5a0.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Ben, can I play with your robot?','["Ben，我能玩你的机器人吗？"]',0,'Ben，我能玩你的机器人吗？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-toys-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-toys-g3/s001-n-ac6ed2.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Sure. But please be careful with it.','["当然。不过请小心一点。"]',0,'当然。不过请小心一点。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-toys-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-toys-g3/s002-n-467d82.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','I will. Do you want to try my car?','["我会的。你想试试我的小车吗？"]',0,'我会的。你想试试我的小车吗？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-toys-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-toys-g3/s003-n-83b727.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Yes! We can play with both.','["好呀！两个都可以玩。"]',0,'好呀！两个都可以玩。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-toys-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-toys-g3/s004-n-074da2.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','You can use my car first.','["你可以先玩我的小车。"]',0,'你可以先玩我的小车。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-toys-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-toys-g3/s005-n-d44099.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Wow, your car is so cool!','["哇，你的小车好酷！"]',0,'哇，你的小车好酷！',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-toys-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-toys-g3/s006-n-b233d1.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Lily, what''s the weather like today?','["Lily，今天天气怎么样？"]',0,'Lily，今天天气怎么样？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-weather-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-weather-g3/s001-n-6921f6.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','It''s cold and rainy. Do I need my coat?','["又冷又下雨。我需要穿外套吗？"]',0,'又冷又下雨。我需要穿外套吗？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-weather-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-weather-g3/s002-n-0af873.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Yes. And please take your umbrella, too.','["要。也请带上雨伞。"]',0,'要。也请带上雨伞。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-weather-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-weather-g3/s003-n-a0f7af.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Where is my umbrella? Is it by the door?','["我的伞在哪儿？在门边吗？"]',0,'我的伞在哪儿？在门边吗？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-weather-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-weather-g3/s004-n-a5ced1.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Yes, it''s next to your boots. Are you ready?','["对，就在你靴子旁边。准备好了吗？"]',0,'对，就在你靴子旁边。准备好了吗？',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-weather-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-weather-g3/s005-n-08490a.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','I''m ready. Thank you, Mom!','["我准备好了。谢谢妈妈！"]',0,'我准备好了。谢谢妈妈！',1,0,1794557334,'ep-card-weather-g3','日常口语','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-card-weather-g3/s006-n-21646b.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Hello and welcome back to Learning English with Minecraft.','["大家好，欢迎回到“用《我的世界》学英语”。"]',0,'大家好，欢迎回到“用《我的世界》学英语”。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-exploringcave-1','探索洞穴','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-exploringcave-1/s001-n-e6a7e0.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','My name is Kenzo. This is English from the Ground Up.','["我叫 Kenzo。这就是 English from the Ground Up。"]',0,'我叫 Kenzo。这就是 English from the Ground Up。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-exploringcave-1','探索洞穴','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-exploringcave-1/s002-n-70d44e.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','So in the last episode, I searched for a place to live and built a basic house.','["在上一集里，我找了住的地方，还盖了一座简单的房子。"]',0,'在上一集里，我找了住的地方，还盖了一座简单的房子。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-exploringcave-1','探索洞穴','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-exploringcave-1/s003-n-6fb40f.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','In between the last video and now, I''ve played a little bit, and I''ll show you what I did.','["从上一集到现在，我又玩了一会儿，我来给你看看我做了什么。"]',0,'从上一集到现在，我又玩了一会儿，我来给你看看我做了什么。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-exploringcave-1','探索洞穴','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-exploringcave-1/s004-n-559853.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','So first of all, I chopped down all these trees.','["首先，我把这些树都砍了。"]',0,'首先，我把这些树都砍了。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-exploringcave-1','探索洞穴','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-exploringcave-1/s005-n-750f47.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','I felt a little bit like Jared Bolsonaro chopping down this entire forest.','["我砍光这片森林的时候，感觉有点像 Jared Bolsonaro。"]',0,'我砍光这片森林的时候，感觉有点像 Jared Bolsonaro。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-exploringcave-1','探索洞穴','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-exploringcave-1/s006-n-bfbd2e.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Hey, it''s lapis lazuli.','["嘿，是青金石。"]',0,'嘿，是青金石。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-exploringcave-2','探索洞穴','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-exploringcave-2/s001-n-3e61a1.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Hmm, lapis lazuli. All right, I have twenty lapis lazuli. Awesome.','["嗯，青金石。好，我有二十个青金石了。太棒了。"]',0,'嗯，青金石。好，我有二十个青金石了。太棒了。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-exploringcave-2','探索洞穴','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-exploringcave-2/s002-n-529a01.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Oh, it''s lava. So lava is what was making it light down here.','["噢，是岩浆。原来下面发光的是岩浆。"]',0,'噢，是岩浆。原来下面发光的是岩浆。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-exploringcave-2','探索洞穴','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-exploringcave-2/s003-n-8366e0.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Whoa, this is a little bit dangerous, but I''m going to build a bridge across this lava with stone.','["哇，这有点危险，不过我要用石头在岩浆上搭一座桥。"]',0,'哇，这有点危险，不过我要用石头在岩浆上搭一座桥。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-exploringcave-2','探索洞穴','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-exploringcave-2/s004-n-3d238a.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','This is scary. Hopefully there are no skeletons here.','["好吓人。希望这儿没有骷髅。"]',0,'好吓人。希望这儿没有骷髅。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-exploringcave-2','探索洞穴','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-exploringcave-2/s005-n-b6b137.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Okay, it looks like we''re safe.','["好，看起来我们是安全的。"]',0,'好，看起来我们是安全的。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-exploringcave-2','探索洞穴','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-exploringcave-2/s006-n-808bf5.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','All right, so the first thing that I''m going to do is start cooking some of the sand inside the furnace, using coal as fuel.','["好，我要做的第一件事，是把一些沙子放进熔炉里烧，用煤炭当燃料。"]',0,'好，我要做的第一件事，是把一些沙子放进熔炉里烧，用煤炭当燃料。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-exploringcave-3','探索洞穴','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-exploringcave-3/s001-n-05d672.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','So once the sand smelts inside the furnace, then it''ll become glass, and I can use the glass to build windows.','["沙子在熔炉里烧好以后就会变成玻璃，我就能用玻璃来装窗户。"]',0,'沙子在熔炉里烧好以后就会变成玻璃，我就能用玻璃来装窗户。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-exploringcave-3','探索洞穴','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-exploringcave-3/s002-n-a846a0.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','But this is going to take a long time to smelt all this glass, so in the meanwhile I''m going to do a little bit more fishing.','["不过要把这些玻璃都烧好需要很长时间，所以这段时间我再去钓一会儿鱼。"]',0,'不过要把这些玻璃都烧好需要很长时间，所以这段时间我再去钓一会儿鱼。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-exploringcave-3','探索洞穴','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-exploringcave-3/s003-n-b53607.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Salmon. Another salmon.','["鲑鱼。又一条鲑鱼。"]',0,'鲑鱼。又一条鲑鱼。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-exploringcave-3','探索洞穴','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-exploringcave-3/s004-n-c284a0.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Oh, a saddle! You can use a saddle to ride certain animals like horses and even pigs. This is cool.','["噢，一个鞍！可以用鞍骑某些动物，比如马，甚至还可以骑猪。这很酷。"]',0,'噢，一个鞍！可以用鞍骑某些动物，比如马，甚至还可以骑猪。这很酷。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-exploringcave-3','探索洞穴','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-exploringcave-3/s005-n-e231f0.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Oh, a water bottle. Okay, well, always stay hydrated. Always drink enough water. That''s important to remember.','["噢，一瓶水。好，要记得一直补充水分。要喝足够的水。这一点很重要。"]',0,'噢，一瓶水。好，要记得一直补充水分。要喝足够的水。这一点很重要。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-exploringcave-3','探索洞穴','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-exploringcave-3/s006-n-e94ccc.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Let''s get the crafting table and the furnace.','["我们把工作台和熔炉拿出来吧。"]',0,'我们把工作台和熔炉拿出来吧。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-firstnight-2','生存冒险','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-firstnight-2/s001-n-b46ea7.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','And let''s place them in this corner.','["我们把它们放在这个角落吧。"]',0,'我们把它们放在这个角落吧。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-firstnight-2','生存冒险','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-firstnight-2/s002-n-3b8929.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Crafting table.','["工作台。"]',0,'工作台。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-firstnight-2','生存冒险','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-firstnight-2/s003-n-6bdadc.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Furnace.','["熔炉。"]',0,'熔炉。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-firstnight-2','生存冒险','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-firstnight-2/s004-n-6a6f33.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Now, let''s put the coal in the furnace to use as fuel.','["现在我们把煤放进熔炉，当燃料用吧。"]',0,'现在我们把煤放进熔炉，当燃料用吧。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-firstnight-2','生存冒险','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-firstnight-2/s005-n-515489.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','And let''s smelt this iron.','["我们再把这些铁熔炼一下吧。"]',0,'我们再把这些铁熔炼一下吧。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-firstnight-2','生存冒险','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-firstnight-2/s006-n-e048cb.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','Hello and welcome back to Learning English with Minecraft.','["大家好，欢迎回到“用《我的世界》学英语”。"]',0,'大家好，欢迎回到“用《我的世界》学英语”。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-losteverything-1','我失去了一切','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-losteverything-1/s001-n-e6a7e0.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','My name is Kenzo, and this is English from the Ground Up.','["我叫 Kenzo，这就是 English from the Ground Up。"]',0,'我叫 Kenzo，这就是 English from the Ground Up。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-losteverything-1','我失去了一切','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-losteverything-1/s002-n-cae684.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','In the last video, I found some carrots and watermelon and planted them here at my house.','["在上一集里，我找到了一些胡萝卜和西瓜，把它们种在了房子这儿。"]',0,'在上一集里，我找到了一些胡萝卜和西瓜，把它们种在了房子这儿。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-losteverything-1','我失去了一切','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-losteverything-1/s003-n-f9eeef.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','And off camera, I was going to expand this farm this way.','["镜头外面，我本来打算把这块农田往这边扩大。"]',0,'镜头外面，我本来打算把这块农田往这边扩大。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-losteverything-1','我失去了一切','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-losteverything-1/s004-n-c82138.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','So I got a shovel and started digging up all the sand.','["所以我拿了一把铲子，开始把沙子都挖掉。"]',0,'所以我拿了一把铲子，开始把沙子都挖掉。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-losteverything-1','我失去了一切','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-losteverything-1/s005-n-5ef22c.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','And as I was digging up the sand, I noticed something.','["我在挖沙子的时候，注意到了一件事。"]',0,'我在挖沙子的时候，注意到了一件事。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-losteverything-1','我失去了一切','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-losteverything-1/s006-n-881f29.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','In the last video, I found this swamp right here, but I didn''t explore it.','["上一集里，我发现了这边这块沼泽，但当时没有进去探索。"]',0,'上一集里，我发现了这边这块沼泽，但当时没有进去探索。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-losteverything-2','我失去了一切','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-losteverything-2/s001-n-a8b60d.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','So now I think that it''s time to explore this swamp.','["所以现在我想，该来探索这块沼泽了。"]',0,'所以现在我想，该来探索这块沼泽了。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-losteverything-2','我失去了一切','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-losteverything-2/s002-n-e91807.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','The swamps are a new biome I haven''t yet explored, a swamp like this in Minecraft.','["沼泽是一种新的生物群系。在《我的世界》里，我还没探索过这样的沼泽。"]',0,'沼泽是一种新的生物群系。在《我的世界》里，我还没探索过这样的沼泽。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-losteverything-2','我失去了一切','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-losteverything-2/s003-n-ba52b4.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','So this should be exciting.','["所以这应该会很有趣。"]',0,'所以这应该会很有趣。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-losteverything-2','我失去了一切','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-losteverything-2/s004-n-c209c6.mp3'),
('oak',3,'英语','I see lots of roots.','["我看到好多树根。"]',0,'我看到好多树根。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-losteverything-2','我失去了一切','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-losteverything-2/s005-n-f8b5b7.mp3'),
