('oak',3,'英语','So in the last Minecraft video, I finished building the house by completing the windows right here and up there.','["在上一集《我的世界》里，我把房子的窗户装好了，这边和上面都装好了。"]',0,'在上一集《我的世界》里，我把房子的窗户装好了，这边和上面都装好了。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-strikinggold-1','挖到金矿','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-strikinggold-1/s003-n-8db5d3.mp3'),
