('oak',3,'英语','Well, in the cave I found a lot of useful resources, but I couldn''t collect them because I didn''t have an iron pickaxe.','["在洞穴里我发现了很多有用的资源，可是没办法挖，因为我没有铁镐。"]',0,'在洞穴里我发现了很多有用的资源，可是没办法挖，因为我没有铁镐。',1,0,1794557334,'ep-video-strikinggold-1','挖到金矿','https://english.example.com/audio/ep/ep-video-strikinggold-1/s005-n-0952eb.mp3'),
